      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T17:06:40Z",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "Makes sense, switched to rejecting it: setban now fails with \"Error: bantime is too large\" when a relative bantime wouldn't fit once added to the current time, next to the existing check for absolute timestamps in the past. The SaturatingAdd in BanMan::Ban is gone and -bantime is left as is.\r\n",
